From a48ae6a7d3156fbe316189ac3a0edc5d29d922b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gr8-ml4 <benjamin.j.millar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:04:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 prefill: GR8_PF_IXSPLIT - each rank scores its quarter of
 the rows on the full-index layers, ids all-gathered (c2, a 4 MB slot run)

- g6_attn_bind_index_append (every row) -> g6_attn_bind_prefill_index_rows (owner rows) -> c2 publish + gather into
  idx_all -> attention with reuse indices; the indexer query stays an all-rows GEMM (cuBLAS picks its kernel by M)
- two-stream lanes: wait_attn / used_attn around the shared attention state (GR8_PF_STREAMS=2 runs, same bits)
- same step lines as without the split (28K and a 136-token prompt); 28K prefill 494 -> 527-534 tok/s offline

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/ENV.md                     |   1 +
 engine/knobs-rs/gr8_knob_ids.rs | 317 +++++++++++++++----------------
 engine/knobs-rs/gr8_knobs.h     | 323 ++++++++++++++++----------------
 engine/runtime/fabric_plan.h    |  10 +
 engine/runtime/prefill.cuh      |  65 ++++++-
 knobs/prefill.yaml              |   8 +
 6 files changed, 400 insertions(+), 324 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/ENV.md b/docs/ENV.md
index da6dc71..bcf295a 100644
--- a/docs/ENV.md
+++ b/docs/ENV.md
@@ -263,6 +263,7 @@ Every rank of one engine must run the same value. The set ones that differ from
 | `GR8_PF_HX` | flag | `1` | 0\|1 | 0 makes the Flash MoE fc1 rotate x per CTA instead of reading rows rotated and scaled once per token by `k_pf_hx`. |
 | `GR8_PF_HXF` | flag | `1` | 0\|1 | 0 runs `k_pf_hx` and `k_pf_hxq` as two passes on GR8_PF_Q8 layers instead of the fused `k_pf_hxqf`. |
 | `GR8_PF_ISGRT_RG` | int | `8` | 8.. | Sets the rows per CTA of the prefill index-score kernel, rounded down to a multiple of 8 (below 8 means 8). Same bits. |
+| `GR8_PF_IXSPLIT` | flag | `0` |  | Mistral Large 4 prefill (all-reduce form): each rank scores and selects the index top-k of only its quarter of a sub-batch's rows on the full-index layers and the ranks all-gather the selected ids (a third prefill collective), instead of every rank scoring every row. Same selections, so the same bits. |
 | `GR8_PF_MOE8` | flag | `0` | 0\|1 | 1 runs the Flash prefill MoE on MXFP8 activations instead of the fp16 passes, and turns on the shared expert's FP8 copy unless GR8_PF_SHFP8 says otherwise. |
 | `GR8_PF_OWN` | int | `0` | 0\|1\|2\|3\|4 | Sets row-owner prefill: 1 = owners compute the next layer's projections, 2 = also the indexer, 3 = owners run all heads of their rows (QO pack), 4 = TP4 pair-owner QO. |
 | `GR8_PF_OWNPERM` | flag | `0` | 0\|1 | With GR8_PF_OWN=3, interleaves the QO owner rows in 16-row blocks instead of contiguous row ranges. |
